cement activity. An enhancement-completion condition likewise lacks textual support. Attaching 'During this period' exclusively to the original October endpoint ignores the express extension of that same parallel run. No materially supported rival exception is retained; the strongest uncertainty is treatment of filings spanning the transition.","run_id":"run.c035765c42fc4ee6802d01c13c69ca0c","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"f7a64d3de90d02e99196d98ccef21e753d809b06de92036166db0eb3639b7449","source_unit_ids":["u11","u17","u4","u7","u9"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Selected control: compulsory e-IP submission route for covered IPD filings"}